{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e940f8ee3eb6003a9b10ba5d65136e253533f2fc49deea9ff09acffcef6a20e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a9795b0c6f1bea5ca18ab26972934ad523b83c26d3731b25f11ce579e0e5ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n怎么知道花音在这里的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d11f184e9b5b567e665e97d502110b699d2a44df8e5a4149c9e522900b9771b6",
      "text": "因为花音君的妈妈打电话来，\n问我练习几点结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03bb95acae0df81b2301cead8dba39c42f78167cbf1496c91eba46bd27df9407",
      "text": "我想着如果要藏起来的话就是这个地方了，过来一看，\n花音君果然在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bd666a25a3dbad8748f31bf482b930fb6256aa780326d2c06a4d5dc5024c78e",
      "text": "这样啊……●●●●プロデューサー\n什么都能猜到花音在想什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e106df84580591187ff3916efe1c3c4467b49f7d4cb63793f9c5c3fd849fced",
      "text": "花音君……能够沉浸在喜欢的事情里，\n我认为是非常美好的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eccc02d9ffff94ed66c23ecfff6db21bf62555bd96e1406707baa4f734af62af",
      "text": "但是，撒谎是不对的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53f099b7344da657842434823722a9a9520afe24337aeaa049306a62ca042d1",
      "text": "对不起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1f666cef43dec224e2911529b44021aa6ee85879c8ac6d74b22b9f2b7b7bbab",
      "text": "花音只是想快点让冬马君看到\n我跳得很好的样子嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e66b83eae9f6fa628ea52b824e7c5ec96492262114df7beeee3666ce26d624",
      "text": "怎么办……花音对妈妈撒谎了。\n回不了家了啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fde35a2599ddf82dca1ee2fbff41d67af9026f9fca0ca1af5b3204c474ec8f97",
      "text": "我也向花音君的妈妈撒了谎，说还在练习。\n……我们一起去道歉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06beb6a2f8bd79f4587f017f860376605137fb5771bfd195fcd86c354ea6b1f3",
      "text": "嗯……\n花音会好好向妈妈说对不起的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
